## 11. Tables

Render a simple bordered table with optional header styling:

```csharp
var table = page.DrawSimpleTable(
    x: 80,
    y: 460,
    width: 360,
    rows: new List<IReadOnlyList<string>>
    {
        new[] { "Item", "Qty", "Price" },
        new[] { "Notebook", "2", "$12.00" },
        new[] { "Pen Set", "1", "$8.50" }
    },
    options: new PdfTableOptions
    {
        FontFamily = PdfFontFamily.Helvetica,
        FontSize = 10,
        CellLineHeight = 12,
        RowLineHeights = new[] { 12d, 13d, 12d },
        AutoRowHeight = true,
        RowHeights = new[] { 26d, 28d, 24d },
        CellPaddingLeft = 6,
        CellPaddingRight = 6,
        CellPaddingTop = 4,
        CellPaddingBottom = 4,
        CellCornerRadius = 3,
        WrapCellText = true,
        HasFooterRow = true,
        RepeatFooterOnEachChunk = false,
        ColumnWidths = new[] { 2.4, 1, 1.2 },
        MinColumnWidth = 90,
        ColumnAlignments = new[] { PdfTextAlignment.Left, PdfTextAlignment.Right, PdfTextAlignment.Right },
        ColumnVerticalAlignments = new[] { PdfVerticalAlignment.Top, PdfVerticalAlignment.Middle, PdfVerticalAlignment.Bottom },
        ColumnValueFormatters = new Func<string, string>[]
        {
            value => value,
            value => int.TryParse(value, out var qty) ? qty.ToString("N0") : value,
            value => decimal.TryParse(value.TrimStart('$'), out var amount) ? amount.ToString("C2") : value
        },
        HeaderFillColor = new PdfGrayColor(0.9),
        FooterFillColor = new PdfGrayColor(0.92),
        AlternateRowFillColor = new PdfGrayColor(0.97),
        BorderColor = PdfColor.Gray,
        BorderLineWidth = 0.7,
        DrawOuterBorder = true,
        DrawInnerVerticalBorders = true,
        DrawInnerHorizontalBorders = true,
        OuterBorderLineWidth = 1.1,
        InnerBorderLineWidth = 0.6,
        OuterBorderStrokeStyle = new PdfStrokeStyle { DashArray = new[] { 4d, 2d }, LineWidth = 1.1 },
        InnerBorderStrokeStyle = new PdfStrokeStyle { DashArray = new[] { 2d, 2d }, LineWidth = 0.6 }
    });
```

`DrawSimpleTable` returns `PdfTableLayoutResult` with table bounds and row/column counts.

`RowHeights` can explicitly set row heights. When combined with `AutoRowHeight`, final row height uses the larger value.

`ColumnWidths` accepts relative weights (not absolute widths). Example: `[2,1,1]`.
`HasFooterRow` marks the final row as footer and applies `FooterFillColor`.
`RepeatFooterOnEachChunk` controls whether footer repeats on each paginated chunk.
`MinColumnWidth`/`MaxColumnWidth` constrain resolved column widths.
`ColumnAlignments` allows per-column alignment overrides.
`ColumnVerticalAlignments` (or `CellVerticalAlignment`) controls top/middle/bottom placement in each cell.
`ColumnValueFormatters` allows per-column value transformation before wrapping/alignment.
`CellLineHeight` controls wrapped text line spacing inside cells.
`RowLineHeights` can override line spacing per row.
Use `CellPaddingLeft/Right/Top/Bottom` for side-specific insets.
Use `CellCornerRadius` for rounded cell fill corners.
`AlternateRowFillColor` applies zebra striping to body rows.
`WrapCellText` and `AutoRowHeight` enable multi-line cell content with dynamic row sizing.
Border controls:
- `DrawOuterBorder`, `DrawInnerVerticalBorders`, `DrawInnerHorizontalBorders`
- `OuterBorderColor`, `InnerBorderColor`
- `OuterBorderLineWidth`, `InnerBorderLineWidth`
- `OuterBorderStrokeStyle`, `InnerBorderStrokeStyle` (dash/cap/join styles)

When called through `PdfFlowContext.AddSimpleTable(...)`, long tables are split across pages and header rows are repeated.

