## 12. Flow Layout

Use flow mode for margin-based writing with automatic page transitions:

```csharp
var flow = document.CreateFlow(new PdfFlowOptions
{
    MarginLeft = 60,
    MarginRight = 60,
    MarginTop = 80,
    MarginBottom = 60,
    ParagraphSpacing = 14,
    KeepHeadingsWithNextBlock = true,
    KeepParagraphsWithNextBlock = true
});

flow.AddTextLine("Flow layout page", new PdfDrawTextOptions { FontSize = 16, Bold = true });
flow.AddBookmark("Flow section");
flow.AddParagraph("Paragraph content rendered within flow margins.");
flow.AddSimpleTable(
    new List<IReadOnlyList<string>>
    {
        new[] { "Feature", "Status" },
        new[] { "Flow context", "Enabled" },
        new[] { "Auto pagination", "Enabled" }
    });

// Optional image helper: scales to available content width
// flow.AddImageScaledToContentWidth("assets/logo.png", maxHeight: 120);
// flow.AddImageFit("assets/logo.png", maxHeight: 120, fitMode: PdfImageFitMode.Contain);
// flow.AddImage("assets/logo.png", width: 80, height: 80, opacity: 0.55);

flow.AddList(
    new[]
    {
        "First bullet item",
        "Second bullet item"
    },
    new PdfListOptions
    {
        Ordered = false,
        FontFamily = PdfFontFamily.Helvetica,
        FontSize = 10,
        MarkerFontFamily = PdfFontFamily.Courier,
        MarkerBold = true,
        MarkerFontSize = 11,
        MarkerColor = new PdfColor(0.1, 0.2, 0.5),
        ItemAlignment = PdfTextAlignment.Justify,
        ItemSpacing = 6
    });

flow.AddList(
    new[] { "Step one", "Step two" },
    new PdfListOptions
    {
        Ordered = true,
        StartIndex = 3,
        NumberFormat = "({0})",
        MarkerGap = 8,
        AlignMarkersRight = true
    });
```

`PdfFlowContext` methods:
- `AddTextLine(...)`
- `AddParagraph(...)`
- `AddSimpleTable(...)`
- `AddImage(...)`
- `AddImageScaledToContentWidth(...)`
- `AddImageFit(...)`
- `AddList(...)`
- `AddBookmark(...)`
- `AddNamedDestination(...)`
- `NextPage()`

Flow table behavior:
- automatically moves to a new page when remaining space is insufficient
- repeats header row (`HasHeaderRow = true`) on each continuation page
- optional continuation notes using `ShowContinuationMarkers`

