## 21. Diagnostics

```csharp
document.Save("output.pdf", new PdfSaveOptions
{
    CompressContentStreams = true,
    CollectDiagnostics = true
});

var diagnostics = document.LastDiagnostics;
```

`PdfPageNumberOptions` supports:
- start number and total-page format (`StartNumber`, `ShowTotalPages`, `Prefix`, `Separator`, `Suffix`)
- placement (`Y`, `MarginX`, `Alignment`)
- font and color (`Font` or `FontFamily` + style flags, `FontSize`, `FillColor`)
- page filtering (`StartPageNumber`, `EndPageNumber`, `IncludePageNumbers`, `ExcludePageNumbers`)
- TOC exclusion (`ExcludeTableOfContentsPages`)
- filtered sequence numbering (`UseFilteredPageSequence`)
- skip flags (`SkipFirstPage`, `SkipLastPage`)

