## 14. Headers and Footers

Add repeated header/footer text across all pages:

```csharp
document.AddHeadersAndFooters(new PdfHeaderFooterOptions
{
    HeaderTemplate = "Canvas.Pdf Demo - {section}\n{date} {time}",
    FooterTemplate = "{page}/{total}\n{title}",
    HeaderAlignment = PdfTextAlignment.Left,
    FooterAlignment = PdfTextAlignment.Right,
    HeaderTopMargin = 20,
    FooterY = 20,
    HeaderLineSpacing = 11,
    FooterLineSpacing = 11,
    MarginX = 40,
    FontFamily = PdfFontFamily.Helvetica,
    FontSize = 10,
    FillColor = new PdfGrayColor(0.4),
    MinimumNumber = 2,
    MaximumNumber = 999,
    UseRomanNumerals = false,
    PageParity = PdfPageParity.Both,
    ExcludeTableOfContentsPages = true,
    UseFilteredPageSequence = true,
    SkipFirstPage = true,
    SuppressEmptySectionTokens = true
});
```

Template tokens:
- `{page}` current page number
- `{total}` last page number
- `{date}` UTC date (`yyyy-MM-dd`)
- `{time}` UTC time (`HH:mm`)
- `{title}` document title
- `{author}`, `{subject}`, `{creator}`, `{producer}` from document metadata
- `{keywords}` from metadata keywords
- `{creationdate}`, `{moddate}` from metadata dates (`yyyy-MM-dd`)
- `{section}` current section name (`AddSection`)
- `{sectionpage}` current section-relative page number
- `{sectiontotal}` total pages in current section
- `{sectionindex}` current section ordinal (1-based)
- `{sections}` total section count
- `{sectionstart}`, `{sectionend}` current section start/end page numbers

Line rendering notes:
- Header/footer templates support `\n` for multi-line rendering.
- Use `HeaderLineSpacing` and `FooterLineSpacing` to control line distance.
- `SuppressEmptySectionTokens` cleans up section placeholders when sections are not configured.

Page filtering options:
- `StartPageNumber`, `EndPageNumber`
- `IncludePageNumbers`
- `ExcludePageNumbers`
- `ExcludeTableOfContentsPages`
- `UseFilteredPageSequence` (applies `{page}`/`{total}` using only rendered pages)
- `SkipFirstPage`, `SkipLastPage`

